  "summary": "能被 a 或 b 整除的正整数是神奇数字，返回第 n 个神奇数字对 1e9+7 取模。",
  "insight": "不超过 x 的神奇数字数量由容斥为 x/a+x/b-x/lcm(a,b)，随 x 单调；二分第一个计数至少 n 的 x。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "最小公倍数计算要用长整型",
    "二分答案本身先不取模",
    "上界可用 n*min(a,b)"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "inclusion-exclusion-binary-search",
      "title": "容斥计数二分答案",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "在数值域查找第 n 个并集倍数。",
      "steps": [
        "lcm=a/gcd(a,b)*b",
        "low=1,high=n*min(a,b)",
        "若 count(middle)>=n 则 high=middle，否则 low=middle+1；返回 low%MOD"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(log(n·min(a,b)))",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/inclusion-exclusion-binary-search/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/inclusion-exclusion-binary-search/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/inclusion-exclusion-binary-search/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
